ops/rebuild-2026-09-29/codex/brief-2.3-rereview-transcript.log:34:Plan: Task 2.3; contract v4 "Action"; C11 (rebuild, with the reference's batched heads as the design and test oracle); I0b; L6. Reviewer: Codex. Depends on the native grammar (Task 1.2, Codex) for real mask tables. Until it lands, heads are developed against a typed table interface with small synthetic tables, and the integration test waits for 1.2.
ops/rebuild-2026-09-29/codex/brief-2.3-rereview-transcript.log:51:## Sampling and replay semantics (contract v4)
ops/rebuild-2026-09-29/codex/brief-2.3-rereview-transcript.log:281:- **`python/owl/kaggriculture/types.py`:** contract v4 in code. It defines the 29-field `KaggricultureObsBatch`, the pinned observation and action enums, and the size constants. `check_contract()` requires leading dims exactly `[E, 2]` and applies per-field bounds: categories in `[0, n)`, exact counts and `globals_int` ≥ 0, ranks in `[0, 12]`, `order_limits` in `[0, MAX_ORDER_LIMIT = 10]`, `tiles_int` ≥ −1 (the sentinels); `market_int` and the float channels are signed and only need to be finite.
