| L9 | BC overfit after about 14.6k updates (held-out NLL 0.761 → 1.954); select by held-out NLL | 5.2 |
| L10 | The 4096 / spm 1 / accumulation 2 cadence ran 2,048 optimizer steps per iteration against Isaiah's 16 | 3.4 |
